    - rid: 7865913072474128595
      type: {class: StickyNoteModel, ns: Unity.Behavior.GraphFramework, asm: Unity.Behavior.GraphFramework}
      data:
        Position: {x: -1821.0486, y: 319.21136}
        ID:
          m_Value0: 13716676385145518399
          m_Value1: 7274335662827538649
        Parents: []
        PortModels: []
        Text: 'Uses a specified ability only if that ability has

          been
          used less than the specific amount of times

          by this enemy this
          fight. (Ex: If an enemy should

          only be able to use a move twice,
          input "2")


          It is important to note that this count only applies

          to
          this node. If other parts of the graph

          allow the use of this
          move, this node will

          in no way impact or be impacted by those

          other
          uses. This can useful if you only want an

          enemy to use a move
          a set amount of times per

          phase/HP threshold.'
